{
  "format": "ovis-conformance/1",
  "scenario": "platform/matrix",
  "title": "One per-runner platform contract run against the freshly built binary: service lifetime without auto-start, process roles with PID plus start token, a foreign protocol generation refused before anything can spawn, and two concurrent clients with observer denial",
  "todo": 60,
  "closes": ["GAP-048", "GAP-049", "GAP-051", "GAP-095", "GAP-121"],
  "delivers": ["IDEAL-001", "IDEAL-034", "IDEAL-071", "IDEAL-093"],
  "excludes": ["EXCL-016", "EXCL-019", "EXCL-027"],
  "platforms": ["linux", "macos"],
  "cases": [
    {
      "case": "happy",
      "summary": "The detached holder outlives the invocation that started it while status and server status never start anything; then, through the binary's connect bridge, process_info names launcher, foreground and background with PID plus start token, and a replaced incarnation loses its authority while the new one reports with its own token.",
      "steps": [
        {"include": {"scenario": "platform/unix-service", "case": "happy"}},
        {"include": {"scenario": "platform/process-info", "case": "happy"}}
      ]
    },
    {
      "case": "failure",
      "summary": "Before any hello succeeds on a connection through the binary's connect bridge, a numeric generation is invalid_params (u64 wire values are canonical decimal strings) and the canonical string \"999999\" is unsupported_generation, each with no result; a terminal.run on that still unauthenticated connection is refused, so nothing spawns. The same endpoint then serves an owner through the bridge and an observer on a direct socket concurrently: the owner's discovery is answered while every mutation the observer sends is forbidden with no result, and the endpoint reports three connections and no panic.",
      "steps": [
        {"serve": {"fixture": "protocol"}},
        {"connect": {"conn": "probe", "via": "bridge"}},
        {"inject": {
          "conn": "probe",
          "base": {"client": {"name": "ovis-conformance", "version": "0.1.0"}},
          "planned": [
            {
              "request": {"method": "hello", "params": {"generation": 999999}},
              "expect": {"/error/data/kind": "invalid_params", "/error/data/field_path": "params.generation", "/result": {"$present": false}}
            },
            {
              "request": {"method": "hello", "params": {"generation": "999999"}},
              "expect": {"/error/data/kind": "unsupported_generation", "/result": {"$present": false}}
            }
          ]
        }},
        {"send": {"conn": "probe", "requests": [
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "spawn", "method": "terminal.run", "params": {"argv": ["/bin/sh", "-c", "printf REFUSED_SPAWNED"]}}
        ]}},
        {"replies": {"conn": "probe", "expect": {
          "spawn": {"/error/data/kind": "unauthenticated", "/result": {"$present": false}}
        }}},
        {"connect": {"conn": "owner", "via": "bridge"}},
        {"connect": {"conn": "observer", "via": "socket", "principal": "observe"}},
        {"hello": {"conn": "owner", "framed": false, "expect": {"/id": "hello", "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000021"}}},
        {"hello": {"conn": "observer", "framed": false, "expect": {"/id": "hello", "/result/machine_id": "machine:0191f1a2-0000-7000-8000-000000000021"}}},
        {"send": {"conn": "owner", "requests": [
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "discover", "method": "rpc.discover", "params": {}}
        ]}},
        {"send": {"conn": "observer", "requests": [
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "run", "method": "terminal.run", "params": {"argv": ["/bin/sh", "-c", "printf OBSERVER_SPAWNED"]}},
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "input", "method": "input.send", "params": {}},
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "resize", "method": "attach.resize", "params": {}},
          {"jsonrpc": "2.0", "id": "doc", "method": "doc.set", "params": {}}
        ]}},
        {"replies": {"conn": "observer", "expect": {
          "run": {"/error/data/kind": "forbidden", "/result": {"$present": false}},
          "input": {"/error/data/kind": "forbidden", "/result": {"$present": false}},
          "resize": {"/error/data/kind": "forbidden", "/result": {"$present": false}},
          "doc": {"/error/data/kind": "forbidden", "/result": {"$present": false}}
        }}},
        {"replies": {"conn": "owner", "expect": {
          "discover": {"/result": {"$equals_file": "schema/ovis-terminal.openrpc.json"}, "/error": {"$present": false}}
        }}},
        {"stop": {"expect": {"/accepted": "3", "/panicked": "0"}}}
      ]
    }
  ]
}
